  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nRunic School companions
    gain +2 projectile pierce and 30% wider projectile visuals, but their attack
    cooldown is 15% longer. This talent is a presence effect and does not stack with
    another copy.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Bullet bounce chance: +2.5%\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nAn astronomer who tracked
    a star the realm's ceiling kept erasing. They left a student in charge and worry
    that leaving made them disloyal. They want to bring back a map drawn under a
    real sky.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s, chill enemies within 2.313 units: 1.5s
    normally, 0.6s on bosses.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: frost, hat, rune.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge
    unless the talent forbids it."
